  "question": {
    "text": "A force of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;acts on the origin of the coordinate system. The torque about the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math>, The ratio of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>It is given that the force&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>The coordinates of the origin is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>.</p><p>The coordinates of the point given is&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>The displacement vector is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Hence, the torque is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>P</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>So, it can be written</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> so <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
